# Features that require desktop processes remain explicitly unavailable on iPad.
platform-automations-unavailable = Automations are unavailable on iPadOS. Manage them in Herdr UI on a computer.
platform-git-unavailable = Git operations are unavailable on iPadOS. Use a terminal on the connected computer.
platform-github-unavailable = GitHub sign-in is unavailable in this iPadOS release.
platform-orchestrator-unavailable = Pull requests, issues, and agent dispatch are unavailable on iPadOS.
platform-usage-unavailable = Plan usage is unavailable on iPadOS. View usage in Herdr UI on a computer.
platform-monitoring-unavailable = CPU, memory, GPU, and listening-port monitoring are unavailable on iPadOS.
platform-teleport-unavailable = Teleport is unavailable on iPadOS. Use Herdr UI on a computer to move this worktree.
